{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UZLRGTLUsMWMarYZGUNLBb","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t// Copyright (c) 2026 Petar Djukic. All rights reserved.\n2\t// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\n3\t\n4\t// cmd/chown implements srd091-chown R1.1-R1.4, R2.1-R2.3, R3.1-R3.3.\n5\tpackage main\n6\t\n7\timport (\n8\t\t\"errors\"\n9\t\t\"fmt\"\n10\t\t\"os\"\n11\t\t\"os/user\"\n12\t\t\"path/filepath\"\n13\t\t\"strconv\"\n14\t\t\"strings\"\n15\t\n16\t\t\"github.com/petar-djukic/go-unix-utils/pkg/sys\"\n17\t)\n18\t\n19\tconst helpText = `Usage: chown [OPTION]... [OWNER][:[GROUP]] FILE...\n20\t  or:  chown [OPTION]... --reference=RFILE FILE...\n21\tChange the owner and/or group of each FILE to OWNER and/or GROUP.\n22\t\n23\t  -c, --changes          like verbose but report only when a change is made\n24\t  -f, --silent, --quiet  suppress most error messages\n25\t  -v, --verbose          output a diagnostic for every file processed\n26\t      --dereference      affect the referent of each symbolic link (this is\n27\t                         the default), rather than the symbolic link itself\n28\t  -h, --no-dereference   affect symbolic links instead of any referenced file\n29\t      --no-preserve-root  do not treat '/' specially (the default)\n30\t      --preserve-root    fail to operate recursively on '/'\n31\t      --reference=RFILE  use RFILE's owner and group rather than specifying\n32\t                         OWNER:GROUP values\n33\t  -R, --recursive        operate on files and directories recursively\n34\t  -H                     if a command line argument is a symbolic link\n35\t                         to a directory, traverse it\n36\t  -L                     traverse every symbolic link to a directory\n37\t                         encountered\n38\t  -P                     do not traverse any symbolic links (default)\n39\t      --help     display this help and exit\n40\t      --version  output version information and exit\n41\t\n42\tOwner is unchanged if missing.  Group is unchanged if missing, but changed\n43\tto login group if implied by a ':' following a symbolic OWNER.\n44\tOWNER and GROUP may be numeric as well as symbolic.\n45\t\n46\tExamples:\n47\t  chown root /u        Change the owner of /u to \"root\".\n48\t  chown root:staff /u  Change the owner of /u to \"root\" and the\n49\t                       group to \"staff\".\n50\t  chown -hR root /u    Change the owner of /u and subfiles to \"root\"."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3ad23a3c-ad01-42df-8317-965d63548b89","uuid":"7038c514-1886-45f2-b9ef-53f9d9e9e993","timestamp":"2026-05-27T14:38:50.578Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5585/cmd/chown/main.go","content":"// Copyright (c) 2026 Petar Djukic. All rights reserved.\n// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\n\n// cmd/chown implements srd091-chown R1.1-R1.4, R2.1-R2.3, R3.1-R3.3.\npackage main\n\nimport (\n\t\"errors\"\n\t\"fmt\"\n\t\"os\"\n\t\"os/user\"\n\t\"path/filepath\"\n\t\"strconv\"\n\t\"strings\"\n\n\t\"github.com/petar-djukic/go-unix-utils/pkg/sys\"\n)\n\nconst helpText = `Usage: chown [OPTION]... [OWNER][:[GROUP]] FILE...\n  or:  chown [OPTION]... --reference=RFILE FILE...\nChange the owner and/or group of each FILE to OWNER and/or GROUP.\n\n  -c, --changes          like verbose but report only when a change is made\n  -f, --silent, --quiet  suppress most error messages\n  -v, --verbose          output a diagnostic for every file processed\n      --dereference      affect the referent of each symbolic link (this is\n                         the default), rather than the symbolic link itself\n  -h, --no-dereference   affect symbolic links instead of any referenced file\n      --no-preserve-root  do not treat '/' specially (the default)\n      --preserve-root    fail to operate recursively on '/'\n      --reference=RFILE  use RFILE's owner and group rather than specifying\n                         OWNER:GROUP values\n  -R, --recursive        operate on files and directories recursively\n  -H                     if a command line argument is a symbolic link\n                         to a directory, traverse it\n  -L                     traverse every symbolic link to a directory\n                         encountered\n  -P                     do not traverse any symbolic links (default)\n      --help     display this help and exit\n      --version  output version information and exit\n\nOwner is unchanged if missing.  Group is unchanged if missing, but changed\nto login group if implied by a ':' following a symbolic OWNER.\nOWNER and GROUP may be numeric as well as symbolic.\n\nExamples:\n  chown root /u        Change the owner of /u to \"root\".\n  chown root:staff /u  Change the owner of /u to \"root\" and the\n                       group to \"staff\".\n  chown -hR root /u    Change the owner of /u and subfiles to \"root\".","numLines":50,"startLine":1,"totalLines":462}}}
